SCOPE

This licence covers the application — its code, layout, wording and
presentation.

It does NOT re-license the underlying data, which carries its own terms
and attribution requirements. See DATA-LICENCE.md. In short:

  • Rates, population and land area data is Crown copyright, released by
    the Department of Internal Affairs and Statistics New Zealand under
    CC BY 4.0. Attribute those agencies, not this project.

  • Household/residential-property counts and average residential rates
    bills are compiled by the New Zealand Taxpayers' Union in its
    Ratepayers' Report. That is a third-party source with its own terms;
    it is not covered by this licence and is not Crown data.

If you reuse this project, carry those attributions through.

NO WARRANTY

Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. The figures it produces
are modelled estimates, not official outputs, and are not a prediction
of any household's rates. See the caveats shown in the application.
